" the application’s <code>&lt;component&gt;</code> in its metainfo file."
msgstr ""

#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/software-metadata.page:301
msgid ""
"The content in this element should be an <link "
"href=\"https://spdx.org/specifications\">SPDX expression</link> which "
"describes the ‘main’ license for the project. This should typically be the "
"license of the code, and not include the license of the documentation or "
"ancillary content."
msgstr ""
"Innholdet i dette elementet skal være en <link "
"href=\"https://spdx.org/specifications\">SPDX-uttrykk</link> som beskriver "
